From 96113f59cabfb36ff6d2d1f31caf9081aaa0e73d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TimeAndDatePro Agent <agent@timeanddatepro.local>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 04:01:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] fix(date-to-words): DayPicker, robust
 copy/download/share, remove test, center actions

Date input:
- Replace text input + native <input type='date'> with a styled button
  that opens react-day-picker (DayPicker) dropdown
- Month/year dropdowns, keyboard navigation, range 1-9999
- Themed with brand-600 accent + brand-50 hover
- Click-outside closes the picker

Action buttons:
- 'Copy result' renamed to 'Convert date to format text' (primary CTA)
- 'Copy' renamed to 'Copy text'
- Robust copy: tries navigator.clipboard, falls back to
  textarea + execCommand for HTTP/insecure contexts
- Download .txt uses new handleDownload helper
- Markdown now DOWNLOADS as .md file (with H1 + metadata),
  no longer copies to clipboard
- Share link uses navigator.share() on mobile, copies URL on desktop
- Reset now shows 'Reset to today' toast and closes any open translate form

Removed:
- 'How it works' section (STEP 01/02/03 placeholders)

Centered:
- .dtw-output-actions (Copy / Download / Share / Markdown)
- .dtw-tabs (5 NotebookLM pastel format tabs)
- .dtw-cta-row (Convert / Reset)
